### 2.3 `.gitignore`

This file lives at repo root. It exists from the first commit. Anything that could leak a secret stays out of Git, full stop.

```
# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp/

# Build output
dist/
build/
.vite/

# Environment variables — NEVER commit
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Testing
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# Vercel
.vercel/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
```
